/* Privacy */
"privacy_policy_title" = "Privacy";
"privacy_policy_updated" = "Updated: 20 October 2026";
"privacy_policy_body" = "EVforME? estimates on-device whether an electric or plug-in hybrid car may fit you.\n\nController: Andrea Ancellotti — andrea.ancellotti@gmail.com.\n\nKept on your phone: km, prices, chosen vehicles, country selection, scenario history, widget/Live Activity snapshots.\n\nSticker photos: used on-device only to read consumption figures; not uploaded for that feature.\n\nLocation (optional): While Using the App, only when you open Nearby chargers, to center an Apple MapKit search. Country for cost estimates comes from your device region or the country picker — not from GPS. Coordinates are not stored or sent to an EVforME backend. No background tracking.\n\nNetwork (optional): bundled vehicle catalog (EEA/manufacturer sources), public energy prices (MIMIT + Eurostat), Apple Maps search results, analytics or lead webhook only if configured. In a typical build, analytics/leads stay local when those URLs are empty.\n\nWe do not sell data and do not use advertising trackers.\n\nAdvisor form: name/email/city only if you submit them with consent.\n\nYou can revoke photo/location access in iOS Settings, skip the lead form, or delete the app to remove local data. Full policy: open the button below.";
"privacy_policy_open_web" = "Open policy on the web";

